loyers in  nevada  station casino is pushing back saying  they've hired more than 1500 employees  and quote  everyone has received the same or better  pay with great station casinos benefits  workers standing united we have the  right to return to work  again we want to stress that stations  casinos  is hiring people back just they just  don't have all the positions  available that they did before the  pandemic the new law took effect on july  1st  and will expire at the end of august  2022  reporting live on the las vegas strip  tonight orgomana 8 news now
 

